From: beardedeagle <randy@heroictek.com>
Subject: [PATCH] fix(daemon): serialize stale instance record takeovers

The in-place fallback must not let multiple contenders acquire one stale
record. Reuse the existing lease ownership guard around stale revalidation
and takeover while preserving initial atomic publication and denied-unlink
recovery. Keep in-place UTF-8 writes complete and truncate by byte length.

Add regression proof for concurrent stale takeover, released-record recovery
with unlink denied, and non-ASCII records above the padding width.

